	//GRM-Intro
	"intro_text_0": "Icyitonderwa ku bakangurambaga: ",

	"intro_text_1": "Kuvuga ingingo zifasha abenegihugu gushyira mu ngiro. Mu gutangira, reka abantu bamenye ibi bikurikira:",

	"intro_text_2": "Mbashimiye ibitekerezo muduhaye mutugaragariza  ibikorwa neza n'ibitagenda neza mu mushinga wacu.  uru rutonde rw'ibibazo rugizwe n'ibice 6. Biri bwihute kandi biraba byoroshye. Mbere yo gutangira hari ibintu bike mugomba kumenya.",

	"intro_text_3": "Mwemerewe kudatanga umwirondoro wanyu niba mubishaka, Gusa kuduha amakuru ni ingenzi mu kubafasha gukemura ikibazo cyanyu",

	"intro_text_4": "Amakuru yose muduha aradufasha kubasha kumva no gukemura ikibazo mufite. ariko ntibibahangayikishe niba ntacyo mwaba mwibuka.",

	"intro_text_5": "Ikibazo cyawe kirabikwa muri sisiteme kandi kizakemurwa na komite nkemurampaka(GRC) mu minsi mike",

	"intro_text_6": "Tugerageza gukemura ibibazo mwatugejejeho mugihe cy’iminsi {x}.",

